### Phase 1: Start Registration
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mohamed Aziz",
  "lastName": "Hafhouf",
  "email": "mohamedazizhafhouf7@gmail.com",
  "phone": "+21612345678"
}

> {% client.global.set("auth_email", response.body.email); %}

### Phase 2: Verify OTP and Set Password
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mohamedazizhafhouf7@gmail.com",
  "otp": "129470",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}